{"3965930": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Puzzle Parasite", "steam_appid": 3965930, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4172240], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Think with physics.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a strange planet built on logic and reaction. Move, charge, and connect cores to activate mechanisms that reshape the environment, unlocking paths, powering bridges, and revealing the ruins beneath the surface.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Solve together or alone.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through a single-player campaign or experience it with a friend. Puzzle Parasite also features a dedicated co-op campaign, built around communication, timing, and shared problem-solving.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Built with care</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level is built with intention. A focused, curated experience where every puzzle is designed to challenge your logic and reward curiosity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cozy yet thrilling first-person puzzle adventure along with calm and satisfying sound effects and music.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First person room based puzzle challenges where every level is intentionally designed: no filler, no repetition, players figure out the mystery at their own pace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Core actions specifically hand crafted to make them feel smooth &amp; satisfying every time you use it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An engaging core mechanic focused on physics, logic, observation, and satisfying chain-reaction problem-solving.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Think with physics.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a strange planet built on logic and reaction. Move, charge, and connect cores to activate mechanisms that reshape the environment, unlocking paths, powering bridges, and revealing the ruins beneath the surface.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Solve together or alone.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through a single-player campaign or experience it with a friend. Puzzle Parasite also features a dedicated co-op campaign, built around communication, timing, and shared problem-solving.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Built with care</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level is built with intention. A focused, curated experience where every puzzle is designed to challenge your logic and reward curiosity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cozy yet thrilling first-person puzzle adventure along with calm and satisfying sound effects and music.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First person room based puzzle challenges where every level is intentionally designed: no filler, no repetition, players figure out the mystery at their own pace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Core actions specifically hand crafted to make them feel smooth &amp; satisfying every time you use it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An engaging core mechanic focused on physics, logic, observation, and satisfying chain-reaction problem-solving.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Puzzle Parasite is a sci-fi puzzle adventure where you wield telekinetic powers and a cricket bat. You send energy cores flying, power alien tech, and avoid deadly lasers, as you go deeper to uncover the hidden secrets. A handcrafted tribute to the classics that made us think in new ways.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Korean, Polish, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Ukrainian, Japanese, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Spanish - Latin America, Swedish, Turkish<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“Puzzle Parasite is shaping up to be one of the most intriguing puzzle projects of 2025. It’s atmospheric, clever, confident, and refreshingly weird in all the right ways.”<br>9/10 – Movies Games and Tech<br><br>“Puzzle Parasite is a solid puzzler that offers a good challenge in either solo or co-op play.”<br>8.9/10 – Xbox Tavern<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965930/3bdcdc91c9099c63ceeababd47a591b3510a3e82/header.jpg?t=1781585749", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965930/26b1e55d9255ceeb246a9f3ac356c07f4f0e5288/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781585749", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965930/26b1e55d9255ceeb246a9f3ac356c07f4f0e5288/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1781585749", "website": "https://www.wrenfall.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel I5 8400 / AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 970<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel I5 10500 / AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce RTX 2080 8GB / Radeon RX 6700 XT<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 6 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recom